      "id": 1,
      "text": "De Peyster was officially established March 24, 1825 from parts of DeKalb and Oswegatchie, named after merchant Frederick de Peyster who funded a local church.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
